.. raw:: html

    <div class="sphx-glr-thumbcontainer" tooltip="gpe_relax only ever finds a stationary vortex state, by imaginary-time relaxation -- it cannot show what a vortex actually does as time passes. gpe_evolve solves the same Gross-Pitaevskii equation in genuine real (lab-frame) time instead,">

